#. STRINGS.JUMPERBRIDGES.OPTIONS.AUTOMATION.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.JUMPERBRIDGES.OPTIONS.AUTOMATION.NAME"
msgid "Direct automation bridges"
msgstr "自动化桥直连"

#. STRINGS.JUMPERBRIDGES.OPTIONS.AUTOMATION.TOOLTIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.JUMPERBRIDGES.OPTIONS.AUTOMATION.TOOLTIP"
msgid "An Automation Wire Bridge or Automation Ribbon Bridge can be placed with either end directly on an automation port or another bridge's end, and that port is connected. Needs a restart."
msgstr "自动化电线桥或自动化排线桥的任一端可以直接放在自动化端口或另一座桥的端点上，该端口即被连接。需要重启游戏。"

#. STRINGS.JUMPERBRIDGES.OPTIONS.POWER.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.JUMPERBRIDGES.OPTIONS.POWER.NAME"
msgid "Direct power bridges"
msgstr "电线桥直连"

#. STRINGS.JUMPERBRIDGES.OPTIONS.POWER.TOOLTIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.JUMPERBRIDGES.OPTIONS.POWER.TOOLTIP"
msgid "A Wire Bridge, Conductive Wire Bridge or Insulated Wire Bridge can be placed with either end directly on a power port or another bridge's end, and that port is connected. Heavy-watt joint plates are unchanged. Needs a restart."
msgstr "电线桥、导电电线桥或绝缘电线桥的任一端可以直接放在电力端口或另一座桥的端点上，该端口即被连接。高功率接合板不受影响。需要重启游戏。"
